<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1078989/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078990" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro Doctissimo et <choice><abbr>Celeberr.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice> D. Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs>.</salute></opener>
  <p>Respons<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ad eruditissim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> Tuam <rs key="B_991170515152805501" type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> 1 X<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><hi rend="sup">bris</hi> anni pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teriti datam us<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que in hunc diem distuli partim ob gravissimas curas medicas, partim
      <lb/>propter baccanalia mentem pessundantia<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Mit «baccanalia» meint Michelotti den venezianischen Karneval. Er schreibt, dessen Treiben habe ihn ganz durcheinandergebracht und abgelenkt.</note> ac ali<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> ducentia. In pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tiar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> tempus est ut ad pristina studia revertar collectisque viribus,
      <lb/>horis <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> praxi medica vacuis, tot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> parvul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> intellect<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ad per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ficiendam me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs> (qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, nisi gravissima <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup"><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissm<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></expan></choice> D.
      <lb/>Mari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1178493288" type="person">Labia</rs> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gritudo impedimento fuisset, in public<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> pro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>sset) dirigam atque accomodem. Tibi aut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> obstrictus sum
      <lb/>Vir <choice><abbr>Ingeniosiss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Ingeniosissime</expan></choice> quod Tuis <rs key="B_991170515152805501" type="letter">litteris</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Im Brief vom 1. Dezember 1717 erläutert Johann seine Antwort am Beispiel einer tragbaren Uhr. Wie deren Räder beim Tragen weiterlaufen, könne auch die aufeinander abgestimmte Bewegung der Teilchen in einem Flüssigkeitströpfchen fortbestehen, während es vom Blut mitgeführt wird.</note> respon<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere volueris ad obiectiones, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> fieri poterant ad convellend<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>
      <lb/>theori<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> de motibus conspirantibus fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in corpore ani<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mali, apprime facient<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ad extricand<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> (quoad fieri potest)
      <lb/>problema de Secretione animali. Probasti quod motus
      <lb/>conspirantes Liquor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> stare possunt etiam si sint per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>turbati a motibus canali<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> elasticor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, cordis atque totius
      <lb/>corporis. Exempl<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> mihi dedisti de horologio portabili, plura<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que alia valde iucunda mihique utilia scripsisti; pro qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus omnibus gratias ago maximas. Mod<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro anne fermen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatio, sive motus Sanguinis fermentativus etiam <hi rend="u">stare possit</hi>
      <lb/>in Statu naturali cum motu lationis, et agitationis sangui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nis: id quod multi Medici hodierni negare audent asserentes
      <lb/>vires fermentationis agere non posse agentibus et pertur<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bantibus viribus contractilibus et distractilibus Cordis et
      <lb/>arteriarum; adeoque Fermentation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Sanguini naturaliter
      <lb/>se habenti inesse negant. Tua doctrina de Effervescentia
      <lb/>et Fermentatione mihi perplacet: quare rogo ut argumenta
      <lb/>nonnulla addas demonstrantia dari posse Fermentationem
      <lb/>etiam in sanguine <hi rend="u">naturaliter</hi> se habente: quam profect<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>
<pb facs="1078991" n="2"/>
      <lb/><hi rend="u">videris supponere</hi> pro explicando motu musculor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>. Quoni<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> autem
      <lb/>vires fermentandi ponere videris in particulis agentibus tetraedri<unclear>c</unclear>is
      <lb/>et patientibus ex tetraëdris bases sibi mutu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> obvertentibus
      <lb/>compositis: peto annon particulis istiusmodi diffrac<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tis (diffringuntur autem pulverisatione potissimum uti
      <lb/>quando nos Medici redigimus in pulver<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> impalpabilem sales
      <lb/>marinos, vitriolicos, aluminosos etc.) in sanguin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> traduc<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tis atque convectis sive sub forma medicamin<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> sive
      <lb/>sub forma alimentor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <hi rend="u">vires insint</hi> Fermentationem
      <lb/>excitandi; ideoque an vires medicamentor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> per figuras
      <lb/>Fermentationi aptas sint explicand<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>: omnia etenim
      <lb/>medicamenta ut in sanguin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> introducantur diffringenda
      <lb/>sunt atque in diversas figuras mutanda ab ea qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ipsis na<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>turalis est. </p>
  <p>Problema, de cuius solutione Te iter<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> rogare audeo, <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filio</rs> Tuo solutum non fuit, quemadmod<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> animadvertit eti<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>
      <lb/><hi rend="u"><choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimus</expan></choice> Tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs></hi>. Peto solution<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> mathematic<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> abstrahendo
      <lb/>a crassitie liquoris fluentis, ab asperitate canali<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> atque id
      <lb/>genus aliis. Considerandus est liquor perfecte fluidus proiectus
      <lb/>continuo sive non interrupto cursu fluens per canalem dati
      <lb/>diametri, datis viribus ita tamen ut suo impetu canalem
      <lb/>(quem suppone flexibilem et elastic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>) dilatare queat,
      <lb/>et revera dilatet altern<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>, canali post dilatationem alter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne etiam se constringente atque vi elastica liquorem
      <lb/>urgente undique ante, et retr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>. Suppono ut retr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>
      <lb/>adsint impedimenta qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> non sinant refluere liquorem;
<pb facs="1078992" n="3"/>
      <lb/>anterius autem nulla adsint impedimenta curs<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> liquoris
      <lb/>per cavitatem canalis impedientia. <hi rend="u">Determinanda</hi> venit in
      <lb/>istis circumstantiis <hi rend="u">velocitas</hi> liquoris fluentis et consideran<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>da sunt motus huius liquoris symptomata nec non <hi rend="u">quid
      <lb/>continget</hi> canali huiusmodi dilatabili et constringibili, cu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>iusmodi est arteria magna, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ad su<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> initi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> prope
      <lb/>Cor sive prope vim impellentem habet valvulas regress<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>sanguinis in Cor inhibentes. Quod cursus sanguinis
      <lb/>in canali elastico sive in arteria sit <hi rend="u">continuus</hi> et non
      <lb/>interruptus; patere<rs key="biblio_EAMI3MDF" type="biblio"> asserit <rs key="pers_DE-588-11757645X" type="person">Gulielminus</rs></rs> in sanguinis mis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sione, in qua uniformi semper fluento sanguis erumpit
      <lb/>a Vulnere arteri<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> aut ven<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> inflicto, non per subsultus, ut
      <lb/>contingeret si par in vasis, ac in corde esset sanguinis agi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatio.</p>
  <p>Deinde facto foramine in dicto canali elastico ita ut liquor
      <lb/>effluere possit et de facto effluat: determinanda est <hi rend="u">veloci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tas</hi> liquoris effluentis in qualibet canali longi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tudine, et positione verticali, horizontali, sive inclinata<choice><orig>.</orig><reg>,</reg></choice>
      <lb/>semper supponendo <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quales et nunquam cessantes vires
      <lb/>Liquor<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> in canalem proiicientes.</p>
  <p>Spero quod mihi respondere dignaberis saltem si tempus Tibi
      <lb/>supererit. Omnes expensas pro litteris, uti feci hactenus, per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>solvam ad tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> libit<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> et imperi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>; et in omnibus qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> potero
      <lb/>Tibi, Tuisque <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144 pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Filiis</rs> inservi<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>.</p>
  <closer><salute>Vale Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> mihique
      <lb/>fave, et impera.</salute>
